# The vendored wgpu-native tree (webgpu-headers included) must stay byte-identical to its archives in
# upstream-downloads/ on every commit and every checkout. The repository root sets
# "* text=auto eol=lf", which would normalise files at `git add`. -text switches every conversion off.
wgpu-native/** -text
# The licence text shipped beside every native binary must be byte-identical on all nine RIDs,
# whichever OS checked the repository out and ran the build. Its inputs (the crates' licence files,
# published by their authors - two of them with CRLF line endings - and the standard texts) too.
licenses/** -text
licenses/*.sh text eol=lf
# Shell scripts, the shared pins and the patches must keep LF to run / apply (Windows checkouts included).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
# The C sources compiled on every platform.
*.c text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
# Native binaries are never text.
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.tar binary
*.tar.gz binary
